                                                "sense_id": "8e70e1ac-e2dc-3d11-9113-10bed77d77dd",
                                                "text": "Trump’s take on his relationship with Kim – and his admission that he didn’t have a broader strategy behind the threats he made about having a “much bigger” nuclear button – are part of a new audiobook that Woodward is releasing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c6e1b77-286f-4a96-bf27-dd8b949712eb",
                                                "sense_id": "8e70e1ac-e2dc-3d11-9113-10bed77d77dd",
                                                "text": "Matt Semrad is an avid reader and devours audiobooks from the library — about one a week. He also spends several hours each day walking his two black doodles, Sirius and Sonny."
                                            }
